WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:39.050
Where are you going?

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.740
Stay away from me!

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:04.640
Running won’t help.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.920
You must fulfill your mission.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.050
Mission?

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:13.690
You, the Pharaoh and Shadi possess the Millennium Items.

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.010
Shadi will give his Items to the Pharaoh.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:21.770
So all the Millennium Items will be in the Pharaoh's and your possession.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:23.700
The time is ripe.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:29.960
But the seven Millennium Items alone cannot open the door to the afterlife.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:35.770
You must find the eighth key that unlocks the seven Millennium Items.

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:37.170
But I…

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:40.580
The eighth key to open the door to the afterlife...

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:44.780
...is hidden in the world of the Pharaoh’s memories.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.780
This has nothing to do with me!

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.530
Nameless Pharaoh…

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:57.520
When the door to your memories is opened...

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:02.670
...the ultimate Shadow Game 3,000 years in the making will begin.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:15.910
The Ultimate Game

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:19.720
- Year: 1960 -

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:28.450
We’re finally here.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.520
It's your last chance to turn around.

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.860
Ahead is the realm of the dead.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:39.160
When the sun sets, darkness devours all - including the souls of the living.

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:44.150
The Valley of the Kings is the burial ground of the ancient Egyptian Pharaohs.

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:48.310
I’ve come here to search for the ultimate game.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:52.200
Over sixty tombs have been discovered in this valley.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:58.820
But no one has ever reached the Pharaoh’s tomb.

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:07.570
Before the Great War, a British explorer left these final words: Shadow Game.

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:09.420
Shadow Game…

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.560
I like the sound of that.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:15.410
There are traps that no one's been able to solve.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:19.570
So great treasure must lie beyond.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:25.580
But as you promised - unlike you, we’re not willing to sacrifice our lives.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:28.580
We’ll guide you to the entrance of the tomb.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:33.090
But from there, you’ll guide us to the treasure.

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:36.590
I know.  I'm not interested in the treasure.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:39.300
Let's take a break and eat.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.590
It's best to raid the tomb at night.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.310
It's time.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:57.050
Yeah.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:03.920
I’ve been wanting to ask you, but what's with those clothes?

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:07.140
You planning a marriage proposal inside the tomb?

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.570
You’re not too far off.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:12.560
Gaming is my only purpose in life.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.940
So I always show respect to my opponents.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:23.070
If I lose a game, I'll change into jeans and overalls and collects years instead of chips.

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:28.320
If you lose tonight's game, you'll lose more than your shirt.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.210
Be careful.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:35.760
I’ve been traveling the world playing cards, chess and gambling.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:39.220
I've played every type of game and won them all.

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:48.230
That's when I heard that the world’s most dangerous game exists in Egypt’s Valley of the Kings.

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:51.770
Here lies glory that no one has ever attained.

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:57.330
This challenge will test my entire gaming career.

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.240
You lead the way from here, Mr. Muto.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:13.680
Who are they?

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.980
A pile of graverobbers' corpses.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.220
The remains of those who lost the game.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.500
Look at that!

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:29.500
Over here too!

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.400
We already found treasure!

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:36.520
Bro!

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:37.280
Yeah!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.610
Don’t move.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:43.300
Why?  We found them first!

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:54.840
The game has already begun.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:07.260
Huh?  It’s a dead end.

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:25.770
Where's the treasure?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.770
So it's all over?

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.770
Don’t be hasty.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:48.050
Beyond lies the final resting place of the great Pharaoh.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:51.050
Trespassers will be judged by the gods...

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:55.050
...who will destroy your bodies and bury your souls in darkness.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:57.670
You can read ancient text?

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:02.590
I'm surprised too, but this must be the real entrance.

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.860
But there’s no entrance in sight.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.400
What?

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:11.800
What’s this?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.040
The entrance.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:21.320
The sun god Horus symbolizes the one who opens the path to the Pharaoh.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.280
What is this place?

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:34.300
This must be the game’s main arena.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:44.590
We can't climb down.

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.220
We have to take the path.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.640
Then let’s go.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.910
The treasure must be up ahead!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.910
I-I don't want to do this.

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:54.770
I don’t want to die here.

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:56.400
I’m heading back.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.410
Be quiet!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:09:00.980
Listen up.  We’re not putting ourselves in danger.

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:05.540
Once he clears this game, we take the treasure.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.660
Bro...

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:10.040
Don't worry.  If push comes to shove...

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.850
R-Right.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:13.950
Well then...

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:21.600
The entrance!

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:27.150
The walls!

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.650
We're gonna be...

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:32.920
Our only option is to walk this path.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.920
But I don't know what traps lie ahead.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.010
Damn!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.080
Hey you!  Hurry up and cross!

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.170
Stop wasting time!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.160
You go first!

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:50.670
Damn, I have to get moving.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:01.220
What?

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.600
I can't dodge all of them!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.960
Do something!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:15.690
If this is a Shadow Game, there must be an answer to this riddle.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:17.800
But at this rate...

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.440
It paused for a moment.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:28.180
This is unfair!

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:31.150
Show respect for your opponent?  Whatever!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:35.050
Respect...  Yes, that must be it!

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:38.050
In ancient Egypt, Pharaohs were gods.

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:43.050
All statues for the Pharaoh have their left feet forward.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:49.590
Since the heart is on the left of your chest, you present your heart to the Pharaoh to show total obedience.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:54.570
This is god's realm, so everyone must show humility.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:58.580
If you don't, you are sentenced to death!

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:03.950
I’ve figured out the puzzle!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:06.080
Move with your left foot forward!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:09.450
If you move your right foot forward, the statues will attack you!

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:10.980
Left foot?

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.950
I’ve never walked like that before!

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.230
Just do it!

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:29.270
Just a little further!  Be careful!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.870
Mushara!

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:53.430
Unfortunately, these are the rules of a Shadow Game.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.520
Keep moving!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.240
This is the second chamber.

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:22.360
The ka dwelling in the stone tablets shall judge you.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:26.100
Demons will devour the souls of the fearful.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:29.980
The courageous shall be shown the way.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.940
Look there!

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:47.330
That must contain treasure!  Go!

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.980
Hurry up!

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.410
I'm sensing something.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.480
Something familiar.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.820
C'mon!  Hurry up!

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:10.600
I'm close to winning this legendary game.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:16.920
Seems he’ll make it safely to the end.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:21.120
Since I now know this bridge isn't booby trapped, I don't need you anymore.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:31.480
You were able to play a Shadow Game.

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:33.520
So you can die happy.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:35.250
You…

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.750
Later, dead man.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.640
The treasure is mine.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.330
Am I hearing things?

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.910
That’s one creepy picture.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:01.900
What?

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:18.240
I've come this far… but it's over...

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:33.760
I’ve been waiting for you, Shimon.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.430
Wasn't I...

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.450
This is my proof for glory.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:10.450
And that’s how I acquired the Millennium Puzzle.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.450
Back in the day, you were pretty cool!

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:18.380
I might have exaggerated a bit.

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:22.930
But why the sudden interest in these old stories?

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.490
Because you’re going to Egypt?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:30.480
Yeah.  The stone tablet in the museum was sent back to Egypt.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:34.470
We're going to Egypt tomorrow.

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:40.420
When I present the three God Cards to that tablet...

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:43.810
...we'll begin the search for my other self's memories.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:49.920
Grandpa, do you remember the location of the Pharaoh’s tomb?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.270
I don't.

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:56.300
I had to hire special guides to get there.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.840
The Valley of the Gods is huge.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:01.370
There are many caves that look similar.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:02.700
I see.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:07.140
Since I’m going to Egypt, I wanted to see where you found the Millennium Puzzle.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:10.150
No!  Don’t go there!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:15.380
Yugi, can I please look at those cards again?

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:18.150
Again?  This is your fifth time!

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:23.660
Just thinking that I won’t see them for a while makes me feel...

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:25.670
Fine, Grandpa!

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:34.940
The God Cards!  I want them...

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:37.140
No!  You can't have them!

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.170
But I'm a collector!

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:44.820
I won't sell them, so leave them in the shop instead of taking them to Egypt.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.180
No means no!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:48.950
I knew it.

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:55.460
You don’t understand how important they are to my other self!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:58.460
You’re right.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:02.740
It's so that the spirit of the Pharaoh inside you can leave.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.280
I’ve been waiting for you, Shimon.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:13.180
Since I was injured, I immediately left with the Millennium Puzzle.

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:19.000
There could've been unexplored areas further within that tomb.

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:25.540
So more tests may lie ahead for the one who solved the Millennium Puzzle...

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:32.300
Yugi, the owner of the Millennium Puzzle inherits the Pharaoh's soul.

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:35.260
And will always be tested.

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:36.510
Tested?

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:41.070
Yes.  You must overcome those challenges, no matter what.

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:45.290
Some things can only be gained by overcoming challenges.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.060
Gain something?

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:50.820
Yes.  Things that can't be explained, like courage and pride.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.050
You’ll know when the time comes.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:56.280
Right!  I won’t lose to any challenge!

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:58.730
That's my grandson!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.000
Time for bed.

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.800
Good night, Yugi.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.790
Good night.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.880
My other self...

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.490
What's wrong, partner?

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:29.980
My other self, I have to tell you something.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.810
I feel you're holding back - for my sake.

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:34.760
Holding back?

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:39.010
A lot has happened since we acquired the God Cards in Battle City.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:47.500
So you've been holding back from searching for your lost memories.

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:56.820
I met you by assembling the Millennium Puzzle.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:01.100
I used to be alone, but ever since you appeared...

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:07.580
...I've made many friends, like Jonouchi, Honda and Kaiba.

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:14.400
You've given me so much that I can't thank you enough.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:19.650
But you're still holding back for my sake.  That's hard to deal with.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:21.150
Partner...

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:25.080
My other self, don't hold back for my sake.

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:28.140
I’ll be fine on my own now.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:31.460
Okay, partner.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:38.530
No matter what happens to me in the future, I’ll never forget you or our friends.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:43.610
My other self, similar to how I assembled the Millennium Puzzle...

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:48.140
...it's your turn to assemble the pieces of your memories.

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:53.310
And we're partners until you achieve your goal!

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:55.210
Right, partner.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:09.770
Yugi would never suspect that we’d come to steal his God Cards.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.820
So let's do it!

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:21.860
Oh oh!  He spotted us!

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:22.740
Run!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.120
Stop!

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:33.240
Where'd they go?

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:39.080
It's my duty to protect the God Cards and the Millennium Items!

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:47.580
We're safe now.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.610
Let’s see those God Cards!

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:53.330
What’s this?

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:08.320
Who’s there?

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:10.580
I'm finally free.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:16.000
You’re that guy who hangs out with Yugi.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:19.550
You want the God Cards too?

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:24.060
I can't have you stealing the God Cards.

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:27.060
You're in the way.  Vanish.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:30.050
What was that?

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.370
Who are you?

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:42.420
Bakura!

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:16.000
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:31.720
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:32.440 --> 00:22:37.560
Without a goal in mind

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:46.130
We just step towards our dream

00:22:46.520 --> 00:22:51.770
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:51.960 --> 00:23:00.240
Your eye will find it

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:06.050
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:14.190
Will touch your soul

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:17.450
In a duel

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:34.850
Yugi decides to go to Egypt to allow the other Yugi to search for his lost memories.

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:40.320
But is Bakura an enemy or an ally?

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:44.200
He retrieved the God Cards from Haga and Ryuzaki...

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:47.530
...but he says it's the start of the ultimate Shadow Game.

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:50.700
He even challenges Kaiba to a duel!

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:53.710
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh:
Dark Bakura On the Move

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:55.380
Duel, standby!
